OPTIONAL SUPPORT

Deathtrap Native 50 is completely free, with no features or downloads locked
behind donations. Voluntary support for continued fixes, development-tool and
AI-subscription costs, or future game-modernization projects:
https://ko-fi.com/utkiduck
